ately for  ladybug the white death thinks he is  actually a man named Carver ladybug's  hated co-worker who bowed out of the job  that ladybug is currently trying to  survive Carver was responsible for  staging the accident that killed the  white death's wife now the white death  has gone out of his way to ensure that  every assassin who had something to do  with the incident is on the train so he  can take them all out at once he's happy  to start with ladybug despite ladybug's  protest that he isn't the man the white  death thinks  before the white death dispatches  ladybug the two henchmen who have been  ordered to open the briefcase ladybug  was supposed to steal finally complete  their task however earlier in the film  Prince got camura to crack the case's  code and rigged it to blow when it was  opened again so as soon as the white  desk goons lift the case as lit it  explodes blowing ladybug back onto the  unmoving train followed by the white  death and several henchmen this buys  ladybug enough time to escape the white  desk clutches the white death is also  distracted by another issue Prince whose  every move has been about assassinating  the crime Lord when the white death  enters the train is confronted by Prince  and she makes it clear that the reason  she's so determined to take him out is  that he's her father princess grievan  seems to be that the white death never  paid attention to her because she's a  girl while most people would seek  therapy to cope with the rejection  Prince has gone another way and even as  she waves a gun in her father's face she  still pursues her end game her father is  known for killing anyone who crosses him  and Prince expects that's exactly what  he'll do to her however earlier in the  movie in anticipation of this exact  moment Prince rigs are going to backfire  killing whoever pulls the trigger the  spider tears princess actually  anticipating besting her father  unfortunately while the white death  accepts the gun he 