ng with ladybug instead of against  him as he has most of the train ride  makes lemon feel a bit warm and fuzzy  thanks  man oh that show's real broke well  ladybug has touched the moment doesn't  last because that's the train speeds  over a bridge lemon jumps out of the  train with one of the white desk men  into the water below  Elsewhere on the train the battle  between the Elder and the white death  continues the men initially seem well  matched unfortunately the white death  quickly manages to turn things around  after all you don't earn the nickname  the white death if you aren't accustomed  to Doling out a substantial amount of  well death for a moment it looks like  the white death is going to add the  Elder to his undoubtedly lengthy list of  victims but then Kimura who between  being shot in the guts and massively  hungover hasn't been especially useful  until this point picks up a water bottle  rolling along the floor and tussles out  the white death's head stopping him  before he can deal his final death blow  as a flashback reveals a water bottle  has played a key role throughout the  story not only did lemon get the bottle  of water for free while buying another  beverage but it was also the water that  ladybug filled with sleeping powder that  lemon drank just in time for it to kick  in as Prince shot him causing her to  believe she'd killed him once again the  water bottle shows up just in the nick  of time ensuring camera can save his  father's life  in the front of the train lady Burgers  finally found the handbook with  instructions in English which includes  information about how to deploy the  emergency brake  [Music]  so ladybug instead just pulls out the  entire emergency brake mechanism wires  and all it gets the job done but it  isn't pretty the screeching breaks bring  the train to a stop way too fast causing  it to jump the tracks as the train  careen's out of control the momentum  causes ladybug to fall back through the  cars and while he